      "source": "Create a new StringTrimmerEditor.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 StringTrimmerEditor。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>emptyAsNull</code> - <code>true</code> if an empty String is to be\ntransformed into <code>null</code>",
      "translation": "<code>emptyAsNull</code> - 如果要将空字符串转换为 <code>null</code>，则设置为 <code>true</code>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Optionally allows transforming an empty string into a <code>null</code> value.\nNeeds to be explicitly registered, for example, for command binding.",
      "translation": "可选地将空字符串转换为 `<code>null</code>` 值。需要显式注册，例如用于命令绑定。",
      "count": 2
    },
